{
  "_comment": [
    "Pilot request, issue #427. tb_adc_offset_mc.spice: sw_stat_mismatch=1 in the netlist.",
    "monte_carlo is klt sim's native object {n, seed, vary}; vary='mismatch' draws a",
    "fresh per-sample `.options seed=` (klt derives it from `seed`), process held at the",
    "single corner. n=8 is a QUALIFICATION pilot, not a campaign size.",
    "d00..d32 are the dout levels of the 33 conversions at differential inputs",
    "D_START + k*STEP (see gen_pilot.py); analyze_pilot.py turns them into a threshold.",
    "batch.runner_version_check='warn' (documented klt request field): run on a fleet runner older than the client instead of refusing. The skew is stamped into the report; whether the old runner honours the per-sample seeds is exactly what the repeat/null/duplicate checks in analyze_pilot.py test."
  ],
  "netlist": "tb_adc_offset_mc.spice",
  "engine": "ngspice",
  "models": {
    "pdk": "gf180mcuD",
    "lib": "libs.tech/ngspice/sm141064.ngspice"
  },
